Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

the problem here is that there has to be one starting value for EACH parameter in the model. You only have 2 starting values....  You need 5.  Moreover, it is very helpful if the starting values are close to the MLE. This is difficult to do without fitting some simpler models to see what reasonable values might be.   (so look at the output from the simpler models and use the parameter estimates as starting values).

regards
andy

